{"data": [{"id": "2122132380848926720", "author_id": "2104770760921272320", "text": "@UPing123zzz 追踪来源这点最容易被低估，答错了能定位到是哪一版文档、哪一段切分，系统才有救。不然每次出问题都是全链路重做，知识库越做越不敢动。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:59:21.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/YunaElira/status/2122132380848926720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122049436427944396", "author_id": "1390955686142517249", "text": "@UPing123zzz 检索链路跑通只是开始，权限、数据更新、引用准确性和评测都影响企业场景。先用真实问题测试，比只看演示更有意义。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:29:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/KevinWeb3Nomad/status/2122049436427944396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122026896032690193", "author_id": "2011372628444151808", "text": "@UPing123zzz 对这种复杂的嵌套关系我感觉只能上本体，但是同样的，我还是不知道怎么避开这头疼的语义开销\n\nPS：需要处理的文档规模是第一轮就是10 万份级别，还没算后续更新的情况", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:00:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/CAI_aways_try/status/2122026896032690193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122026441026265222", "author_id": "2011372628444151808", "text": "@UPing123zzz 为了改善这个问题，不得不把数据工程做得越来越细，增加大量标签和关联信息。可检索质量越好，召回的相关内容越多，模型反而越难在其中建立准确的语义联系\n\n看少了，不行，可能无法理解业务，完整看呢？那语义带来的开销无法估量，是不可能进入生产场景的更别说交付了", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:58:23.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/CAI_aways_try/status/2122026441026265222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122026083734487244", "author_id": "2011372628444151808", "text": "@UPing123zzz 而且即使是A，也可能存在A1A2等多个版本。描述的主体、过程和细节完全不同。就像两个版本都说“我今天去学校了”，一个讲的是去食堂吃饭，另一个讲的是去教室上课。它们既有关联，又不能简单地合并或视为重复\n\n那么问题就来了：为了完整理解业务，必须尽可能召回所有相关文档；但噪声也会达到夸张的级别", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:56:58.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/CAI_aways_try/status/2122026083734487244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122025494715797904", "author_id": "2011372628444151808", "text": "@UPing123zzz 深有同感，最近也因为一个 RAG 项目焦头烂额，第一次遇到这么棘手的情况\n\n我实在琢磨不出文档之间复杂的嵌套和语义关联要怎么处理。 A 文件引用了 B 文件，要理解 A 就必须先理解 B，但 B 可能又引用了 C，一看C发现C是DEF并案起来讨论的结果，所以我可能还得接着查", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:54:37.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/CAI_aways_try/status/2122025494715797904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121923868600496158", "author_id": "2104048772204707840", "text": "@UPing123zzz 跑通链路像是把水管接上了，水干不干净还得另验 😂 企业场景里文档更新、权限隔离、检索评测和引用溯源都得跟上，尤其要能发现“答得很像但依据不对”。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:10:48.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/YourPoseDIY/status/2121923868600496158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121923166096478569", "author_id": "1878345967780646912", "text": "@SicanianSun 是的", "lang": "ja", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:08:00.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2121923166096478569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 155, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121917186034077731", "author_id": "61542451", "text": "@UPing123zzz 把检索命中和答案忠实度分开评估，调参才有方向", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:44:15.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SicanianSun/status/2121917186034077731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 172, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121916067543155127", "author_id": "965707616843370497", "text": "@UPing123zzz 跑通 demo 到知识库真能用，中间隔着一整个数据清洗", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:39:48.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/yikailu/status/2121916067543155127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121902963627327771", "author_id": "1878345967780646912", "text": "@Curingieul 是的，这也就解释了为什么Evaluate这么重要了。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:47:44.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2121902963627327771", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121902887261663510", "author_id": "1878345967780646912", "text": "@Daibw24 对的，还是要从零到一去进行审查。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:47:26.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2121902887261663510", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 209, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121898105528619514", "author_id": "2062437407174381568", "text": "@UPing123zzz 跑通检索链路那天我也以为自己会 RAG 了，结果一换真实文档就全是脏数据。RAG 的坑从来不在模型，在文档本身有多乱。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:28:25.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Daibw24/status/2121898105528619514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121883596277395894", "author_id": "2086344132163989504", "text": "@UPing123zzz 检索和生成拆开评测，错了才知道先查哪层", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T08:30:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Curingieul/status/2121883596277395894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2104770760921272320", "username": "YunaElira", "name": "Yuna Han", "verified": false}, {"id": "1878345967780646912", "username": "UPing123zzz", "name": "Ethan 恩宇", "verified": false}, {"id": "1390955686142517249", "username": "KevinWeb3Nomad", "name": "Kevin Lin", "verified": false}, {"id": "2011372628444151808", "username": "CAI_aways_try", "name": "CAI_awaystry", "verified": false}, {"id": "2104048772204707840", "username": "YourPoseDIY", "name": "香港老张", "verified": false}, {"id": "61542451", "username": "SicanianSun", "name": "Desmond", "verified": false}, {"id": "965707616843370497", "username": "yikailu", "name": "yikailu", "verified": false}, {"id": "2086344132163989504", "username": "Curingieul", "name": "Curing", "verified": false}, {"id": "2062437407174381568", "username": "Daibw24", "name": "daibowen", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122132380848926720", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovrkjip8kpzrqcu5tuc1ec3ajct", "oldest_id": "2121883596277395894", "result_count": 14}}